  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/f72be4d105a484fcfbad3107b34574d0c56418bd.png\" alt=\"預覽\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffabricmc.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Mod_Loader-Fabric-f0eddb?style=flat-square\" alt=\"模組載入器\"></a> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Environment-Server_&_Client-green?style=flat-square\" alt=\"運行環境\"> <a href=\"https://github.com/UkrainianCoder/villagerlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Source-GitHub-181717?style=flat-square&logo=github\" alt=\"GitHub\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fvillagerlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/VillagerLock-Modrinth-00AF5C?style=flat-square&logo=modrinth\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/villager-lock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/VillagerLock-CurseForge-f38231?style=flat-square&logo=curseforge\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a></p>\n<h1>✨完全掌控你的交易大廳！</h1>\n<p>一款偏向原版的 <strong>Fabric</strong> Minecraft 模組，新增<strong>村民柱</strong>，幫助你以優雅且精確的方式管理交易大廳。</p>\n<h1>🎮 使用方法</h1>\n<p>要確保村民嚴格鎖定在特定方塊上，請依照以下步驟：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>放置柱子：</strong>在你想要的位置放置村民柱。</li>\n<li><strong>安置村民：</strong>將村民直接放置在柱子上</li>\n<li><strong>分配職業：</strong>在他們正前方放置職業方塊（工作站），以鎖定他們的交易。</li>\n<li><strong>紅石控制：</strong>如果柱子受到紅石信號供電，它將不再固定村民，允許其自由移動。 <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/9a9929335eb7532021976dd8feffb5a6362586be.png\" alt=\"1\"></li>\n</ul>\n<h1>📦 合成</h1>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/057e821583fbd76dda3e77cdd55c009f56529698.png\" alt=\"合成配方\"></p>",
